WEBVTT

00:12:59.752 --> 00:13:03.935
to embrace the opportunities
and challenges

00:13:03.959 --> 00:13:06.420
that breath analysis can provide,

00:13:06.444 --> 00:13:09.846
even for people that are not
part-time hypochondriacs like me.

00:13:10.532 --> 00:13:11.689
Thank you.

00:13:11.713 --> 00:13:15.730
(Applause)